# Exclude internal workbench and transient artifacts from starter bundle
cmos/
dist/
SESSIONS.jsonl
*.log
# ...but evidence logs under reports/ are the receipt, not transient output.
# Sprint 55 RBAC-3: the blanket *.log rule silently kept 21 production-evidence
# logs across sprints 50, 52 and 54 untracked, including the only record of the
# Sprint 54 SEC-3 production rbac_verify run. A receipt whose log is ignored is
# not a receipt.
!reports/**/*.log
telemetry/events/*.tmp
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
